      <activity id="fc9c7158-3dfb-5758-a39e-75e407c4bb04" activityNameId="72cc9178-8b08-5f56-b039-13ab1bfbf90f" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, Vogelsang-Kioto Solar, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Photovoltaic panel, single-Si, Vogelsang-Kioto Solar, at plant
The modules produced at Kioto Solar have a weight of 22.5kg/m2. The rated nominal power is about 125Wp/m2 (applies to modules with colour coating, 100% coverage).;
Synonyms: Solarmodul, PV-module, monocrystalline, silicon; 
UUID: f73c05da-66c9-3fcf-a47c-1d0b2c61a4b0
Electricity use, materials, transport of materials, treatment of production wastes. Disposal after end of life.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Unspecified
Time period: Time of publication.
Production volume: Approximately 99000 MW for total c-Si in 2018
Sampling: Based on literature data and producer information 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f73c05da-66c9-3fcf-a47c-1d0b2c61a4b0.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
